Wine wintrust: implement CryptSIPCreateIndirectData for PE files, hashing the image the way Authenticode does (without the checksum, the security directory entry and the certificate table) and returning SPC_PE_IMAGE_DATA with the digest. Fenix.exe 3.0 checks its own signature with it; the stub returned FALSE, and the Fenix runner exited with code 0 before writing a log, so the aircraft never got its systems.
Applies to wine-cachyos with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

--- a/dlls/wintrust/crypt.c
+++ b/dlls/wintrust/crypt.c
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@
